7517
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:48,210
Now we are getting far into the game.

7518
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:53,000
Seven members of the Gremory team
remains against three of the Bael team!

7519
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:55,800
However, the remaining members are strong!

7520
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,220
Will they be able to turn things around?!

7521
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:59,550
Well, then. Shoot your dice!

7522
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:04,310
A total of nine! The total is nine!

7523
00:19:07,430 --> 00:19:08,850
I will go.

7524
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:12,690
I believe their Queen will
come out in this match.

7525
00:19:12,690 --> 00:19:14,440
I understand, Akeno.

7526
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,940
I'm depending on you.

7527
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:18,860
Yes, let us all win together.

7528
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:24,370
There is a good chance that we can
win if Issei goes out in this match.

7529
00:19:24,370 --> 00:19:25,040
Huh?

7530
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:28,250
But, only if you used the Triaina.

7531
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:32,890
You should only use the Triaina
at the end of the Game.

7532
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:38,590
Akeno knows this and volunteered to go out
even though it is disadvantageous to her.

7533
00:19:38,590 --> 00:19:42,930
She plans to wear down the enemy to help
in the coming matches for President and Issei.

7534
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:45,250
Everyone has prepared themselves for this.

7535
00:19:45,810 --> 00:19:48,390
Especially after watching
Koneko and Gasper fight.

7536
00:19:50,190 --> 00:19:52,060
You are more skilled than I expected.

7537
00:19:55,190 --> 00:19:56,320
In that case...

7538
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:09,080
My Hole can absorb an
opponent's attack and disperse it.

7539
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:10,540
Like this.

7540
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:18,210
Winner of match five is Kuisha Abaddon!

7541
00:20:18,210 --> 00:20:22,180
Her Power of Hole has defeated Himejima Akeno!

7542
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:25,140
No way, Akeno...

7543
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:26,810
Akeno?!

7544
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:28,100
Calm down.

7545
00:20:29,180 --> 00:20:30,850
Let's stay calm.

7546
00:20:31,350 --> 00:20:33,560
Everything will depend on the last battle.

7547
00:20:33,770 --> 00:20:35,270
Yes, President...

7548
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,650
Now then, we are reaching
near the end of the Game!

7549
00:20:37,650 --> 00:20:41,200
What number will come up next? Shoot your dice!

7550
00:20:42,360 --> 00:20:46,910
Oh! There it is! The number
12 has finally appeared!

7551
00:20:46,910 --> 00:20:52,620
This number means that
Sairaorg can finally participate!

7552
00:20:55,670 --> 00:20:59,420
Issei, will you allow me to go?

7553
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:00,880
Kiba...

7554
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:04,720
I want to wear down our
opponent as much as possible.

7555
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:08,220
Xenovia. Rossweisse. Will you accompany me?

7556
00:21:08,220 --> 00:21:10,100
Yeah, of course.

7557
00:21:10,100 --> 00:21:12,060
I will devote all my strength to it.

7558
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:13,440
Everyone...

7559
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:18,270
We have all been saved
by meeting you, President.

7560
00:21:18,270 --> 00:21:21,900
We were able to get this
far because of your love.

7561
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:26,320
I understand. I'm depending on the three of you.

7562
00:21:26,740 --> 00:21:29,330
We shall surely bring you victory.

7563
00:21:29,330 --> 00:21:30,490
Take care of the rest.

7564
00:21:30,490 --> 00:21:32,200
Yeah, leave it to me.

7565
00:21:39,750 --> 00:21:43,760
Did Rias think of this? It looks like
she's breaking out of her shell.

7566
00:21:44,170 --> 00:21:45,930
We will not die easily.

7567
00:21:47,090 --> 00:21:48,600
What wonderful words!

7568
00:21:48,930 --> 00:21:52,560
We will send you to the Red Dragon
Emperor in the best of states!

7569
00:21:54,390 --> 00:21:57,770
All of you just continue to
heighten my excitement!

7570
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:03,860
Now, let the sixth match begin!

